<Base
  title="About AudioLocal | Audio, video and PDF converter"
  description="AudioLocal converts audio, video and PDF for free, with no sign-up and no ads. Learn who we are and how the tools work."
  path="/en/about.html"
  alternate="/about.html"
  lang="en"
  active="about"
  ogTitle="About AudioLocal"
  ogDescription="Audio, video and PDF in one place, free, with no sign-up and no ads."
  ogImageAlt="AudioLocal, an audio, video and PDF converter"
>
  <article class="doc prose">
    <h1 class="title">About AudioLocal</h1>
    <p class="lead">Audio, video and PDF in one place. Free, with no sign-up and no ads.</p>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>AudioLocal was created to make converting a file simple: open it, choose, download. No accounts to create, no paying to remove ads, and no jumping between different sites for each file type.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <h3>Audio</h3>
      <p>Convert <strong>MP3, WAV, OGG, AAC, M4A and FLAC</strong> to MP3, WAV, OGG or AAC, in batches, and pull the audio out of a video.</p>
      <h3>Video</h3>
      <p>Convert and compress <strong>MP4, MOV, M4V, MKV, WebM and TS</strong>, choosing the format, quality and resolution.</p>
      <h3>PDF</h3>
      <p><strong>Go from PDF to image and image to PDF, merge and split</strong> documents.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Today every tool runs in your browser, so there is no upload to wait for. If a feature ever needs a server, the tool will tell you before sending the file.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>Why choose AudioLocal</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Nothing to install</li>
        <li>Works on computers and phones, though video conversion runs best on a computer with Chrome or Edge</li>
        <li>Completely free, with no limit on conversions</li>
        <li>No sign-up or account</li>
        <li>No ads and no watermarks</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Have a question or a suggestion, or did you find a bug?<br />Write to us at: <a href="mailto:audiolocal.app@gmail.com">audiolocal.app@gmail.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
